   "title": "【大阪市城東区】夏祭りの季節がやって来ました♪各地域で祭り・盆踊りが開催されます。",
   "html": "<div id=\"attachment_53560\" style=\"width: 1290px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-53560\" class=\"size-full wp-image-53560\" src=\"https://tsurumi-joto.goguynet.jp/wp-content/uploads/sites/15/2025/07/32852865_m.jpg\" alt=\"祭イメージ\" width=\"1280\" height=\"961\" srcset=\"https://tsurumi-joto.goguynet.jp/wp-content/uploads/sites/15/2025/07/32852865_m.jpg 1280w, https://tsurumi-joto.goguynet.jp/wp-content/uploads/sites/15/2025/07/32852865_m-768x577.jpg 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1280px) 100vw, 1280px\" /><p id=\"caption-attachment-53560\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">《イメージ画像》</p></div>\n<p>夏休みも始まり、子どもたちにとってはお楽しみの行事が多いこの季節。</p>\n<p>各地域で、夏から秋にかけて令和8年の祭りや盆踊りが開催されます。</p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-55177\" src=\"https://tsurumi-joto.goguynet.jp/wp-content/uploads/sites/15/2026/07/IMG_7495.jpg\" alt=\"各地域の日程\" width=\"1280\" height=\"960\" srcset=\"https://tsurumi-joto.goguynet.jp/wp-content/uploads/sites/15/2026/07/IMG_7495.jpg 1280w, https://tsurumi-joto.goguynet.jp/wp-content/uploads/sites/15/2026/07/IMG_7495-768x576.jpg 768w, https://tsurumi-joto.goguynet.jp/wp-content/uploads/sites/15/2026/07/IMG_7495-1024x767.jpg 1024w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1280px) 100vw, 1280px\" /></p>\n<div class=\"alert alert-info\"><span style=\"font-size: 1.143em\"><strong>■聖賢</strong></span><br />\n7月25日（土）<br />\n15：00～<br />\n【場所】聖賢小学校</div>\n<div class=\"googlemaps\">\n\t\t\t\t<iframe loading=\"lazy\" width=\"600\" height=\"450\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" marginheight=\"0\" marginwidth=\"0\"  src=\"https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3280.316489411915!2d135.54308659999998!3d34.6971965!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x6000e0dd970a9c1f:0x5116d67fab15b59e!2z5aSn6Ziq5biC56uL6IGW6LOi5bCP5a2m5qCh!5e0!3m2!1sja!2sjp!4v1784388986069!5m2!1sja!2sjp\"></iframe>\n\t\t\t</div>\n<div class=\"alert alert-info\